  "description": "Reborn into a new life, Aisya is raised to be a spy for House Poz. At just 5 years old, she receives her first mission: pose as Duke Krost’s long-lost daughter and infiltrate his duchy. Recognizing the plot, she knows carrying out her orders will end in death. After dying tragically in her last life, Aisya refuses to accept another unhappy end—choosing instead to betray House Poz and side with Duke Krost. But can she outrun her fate and claim the happy life she has been denied in both lives?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
